the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Vertragsfähigkeit of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    the Angebot angenommen of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    the Verhandlung abgebrochen of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Vertragsabschluss holds for *a case*.
    Vertragsfähigkeit geprüft holds for *a case*.
    Verhandlungsrunde holds for *a case*.
    Angebot angenommen holds for *a case*.
    Verhandlung abgebrochen holds for *a case*.
    Verhandlungsrunde is decided for *a case*.
    Verhandlungsrunde would hold for *a case*; unknown.
