    Verhandlung abgebrochen is decided for *a case*.

the knowledge base r6_4_contract_negotiation includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/contract-negotiation.ruml".

Vertragsabschluss holds for a case if
    Vertragsfähigkeit geprüft holds for the case
    and Verhandlungsrunde holds for the case.

Vertragsfähigkeit geprüft holds for a case if
    the Vertragsfähigkeit of the case is true.

Verhandlungsrunde holds for a case if
    Angebot angenommen holds for the case.

Verhandlungsrunde holds for a case if
    Verhandlung abgebrochen holds for the case.

% A round that no exit decides: RUML's evaluator goes on to its depth limit, and answers undefined (§6.4).
Verhandlungsrunde holds for a case if
    it is not the case that Verhandlungsrunde is decided for the case
    and Verhandlungsrunde would hold for the case.

Verhandlungsrunde is decided for a case if
    Angebot angenommen is decided for the case
    and Angebot angenommen holds for the case.

Verhandlungsrunde is decided for a case if
    Verhandlung abgebrochen is decided for the case
    and Verhandlung abgebrochen holds for the case.

Angebot angenommen holds for a case if
    the Angebot angenommen of the case is true.

Angebot angenommen is decided for a case.

Verhandlung abgebrochen holds for a case if
    the Verhandlung abgebrochen of the case is true.

Verhandlung abgebrochen is decided for a case.

